The analysis is divided in two parts. 

- Data preprocessing is generated in Python in the folder "preprocessing". 

- The main results is conducted in R to ensure greater platform independence and can be found in the folder "analysis"

Both folders, in turn, contain README files with detailed instructions. 

Run run.py to execute all codes together and replicate the package.

Run master.py in the preprocessing folder and the main.py in the analysis folder to replicate the package separately by stage.

The required conda environment is specified in environment.yml.